    <informations>Shelly 1PM Gen4 — mounting plate, back view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: O SW L L L N N.
Back view: the terminal order is mirrored against the front label face.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-1pm-gen4
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_a209db7a5fc7f7f849c7602efce328ca1d95a12ed688b42518205b23f3141fb1/Shelly%201PM%20Gen4.jpg?cb=b912aa5557cff8b69f8ed4ebaff164da
